perm_general_csp[] = Content Security Policy: profiles and reports

csp_profiles_intro = A profile applies to every host that matches one of its patterns. The first matching profile in file order wins. The file lives in <code>redaxo/data/addons/csp/profiles.yml</code> and belongs in the project repository. A change made here is overwritten by the next deploy when the file in the repository differs.
csp_profiles_live = Live mode is active, so the profiles cannot be changed here. They are stored in <code>redaxo/data/addons/csp/profiles.yml</code>. If the website is published by a deploy or from Git, change the file in the project. Without a deploy, edit the file directly on the server (for example by FTP or SFTP), the change applies at once.
